// SPEC qa.md appendix section 1: "A type word may head a suffix chain: `U8.[max]` (attribute of the type)".
// docs 07-typesystem: "cassert(U8.[max] == 255 and S4.[min] == -8)".
cassert(U8.[max] == 255 and S4.[min] == -8)
cassert(U8.[bits] == 8 and S4.[max] == 7)
